    "detailed_description": "The main character wants to have peaceful days again.<br>Fight to regain a castle that has been ruled by the enemy.<br>Defeat the enemies that appear one after another with your sword and overcome the traps to advance.<br>Defeat the six bosses lurking in the depths and restore peace.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189930/extras/9bb269b0277d6f2d9a9057e2789f667b.avif?t=1727622270\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br><br>Game description<br>It is a side-scrolling action game.<br>The player controls the player and defeats the enemies that appear one after another to advance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189930/extras/58e1b4eff979d845ab731c318c5fa091.avif?t=1727622270\" width=616 height=172 /></span><br>The stage has a door for each room.<br>In order to pass through the door, the conditions must be cleared.<br>There are also traps on the stage, so you need to be careful.<br><br>Attack the approaching enemy.<br>It disappears when the damage exceeds a certain level.<br>By pressing the button repeatedly, you can attack up to 5 combos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189930/extras/89a8dcb9ab8b64708b41da66c7a67902.avif?t=1727622270\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br>However, if a player takes more than a certain amount of damage, they will lose their equipment and clothing.<br><br>In the middle and at the end of the stage, there is a floor stage.<br>Movement on the floor stage is 3D, and you need to play with the camera.<br><br>If you advance to the end of the stage, you will be on the floor stage with a boss.<br>Here, if you defeat a certain number of enemies, a boss will appear.<br><br>If the boss takes more than a certain amount of damage, he will lose his equipment and costumes.<br><br>In other words, it's a battle of &quot;undressing&quot; vs. &quot;undressing&quot;.<br><br>There are 6 stages, and each stage consists of multiple scenes.<br>Each time you clear a stage, you'll get enemy weapons and costumes.<br><br>Good luck!<br><br>This game is intended for an adult audience.",
